         <component>
            <section ID="ID_30aaa9ca-a07d-4b0a-9d26-2ce9c3c8b454">
               <id root="d64a6a1d-fa02-4cbf-b8eb-0a5fc2174309"/>
               <code code="44425-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="STORAGE AND HANDLING SECTION"/>
               <title>STORAGE</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Store at 20° to 25°C (68° to 77°F) [see USP Controlled Room Temperature]. Keep container tightly closed.</paragraph>
